          "value": {
            "$type": "sh.tangled.repo.pull",
            "body": "systemd-volatile-root uses only 25% of RAM for the rootfs, which is\nbelow the tmpfs default of 50% and makes it hard to do anything useful.\nThere is no way to change this, so instead, we use a simple custom\nscript to set up the rootfs before the initrd exits, with a better size\nused.",
